Error [E3111]: Write swizzle `xx` repeats a lane on `Vec3`
  --> tests/ui/swizzle_overlap_write.jet:4:7
    |
  4 |     v.xx = Vec2(9.0, 8.0)
    |       ^^
 Why: Each lane may be written at most once — overlapping patterns like `v.xx` have no single meaning
 Fix: Assign each lane once, e.g. `v.xy = …` instead of `v.xx = …`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3111
